{"id":"33531695011","kind":"answer","title":"今年前三季度结婚登记 474.7 万对，比去年大幅下降，第三季度登记数创下单季度新低，如何看待此数据？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2024-11-17","updated":"2024-11-17","votes":202,"comment_count":39,"minutes":1,"chars":582,"keywords":["人口下降","低生育率","人口转型","未来情景","生育技术"],"summary":"我高中同学去年结婚，今年就离了。 真不敢结。 怎么看待呢。。。 先看看数据吧： 数据来源： 为什么把95后从90后拎出来单独讨论？ by @古都闲云 数据来源： Millennials are not getting married 从图中来看，美国 90 后女性在 25 岁时，有 ～25% 结过婚。而东大 90 后在 25…","question_detail_html":"<p>据民政部统计季报，2024年前三季度结婚登记474.7万对，比2023年同期的569.0万对减少94.3万对。</p><p><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.mca.gov.cn/mzsj/tjsj/2024/2024dsjdtjsj.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"visible\">mca.gov.cn/mzsj/tjsj/20</span><span class=\"invisible\">24/2024dsjdtjsj.htm</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-795bb69cad9bc17f39c7be68c969c958_r.jpg\" width=\"1176\"/></figure><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2827501571/answer/33531695011","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"相关译文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"sPr8RSZB\">我高中同学去年结婚，今年就离了。</p><p data-pid=\"kCxAmKR8\">真不敢结。</p><p data-pid=\"LVdmiFED\">怎么看待呢。。。</p><p data-pid=\"LTrdQZeq\">先看看数据吧：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-729cce106093aeb54170e8836cbb34c9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c17615966913bb35d9073596b121632e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-c17615966913bb35d9073596b121632e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1452\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-729cce106093aeb54170e8836cbb34c9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c17615966913bb35d9073596b121632e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c17615966913bb35d9073596b121632e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1452\"/></figure><blockquote data-pid=\"3Ypr8Gt_\">数据来源：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/273736481/answer/3610243196\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">为什么把95后从90后拎出来单独讨论？</a> by <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"8371bdb66636dfd67cf1aa178c3768e6\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$8371bdb66636dfd67cf1aa178c3768e6\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/8371bdb66636dfd67cf1aa178c3768e6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@古都闲云</a> </blockquote><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-original-token=\"v2-18943b6e044d66aa18bae81abd7b0d10\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-18943b6e044d66aa18bae81abd7b0d10_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-18943b6e044d66aa18bae81abd7b0d10\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-18943b6e044d66aa18bae81abd7b0d10_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><blockquote data-pid=\"LPi-QhQy\">数据来源：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.allendowney.com/blog/2020/10/21/millennials-are-not-getting-married/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Millennials are not getting married</a></blockquote><p data-pid=\"4wuNHdFu\">从图中来看，美国 90 后女性在 25 岁时，有 ～25% 结过婚。而东大 90 后在 25 岁时，有 ～55% 结过婚。从这里来看，我们还是遥遥领先的。</p><p data-pid=\"pyBFSqaj\">不过，美国 90 后和 80 后之间的巨大差异（降幅 ～20%），也同样发生在东大 90 后和 95 后之间。东大 95 后在 25 岁时，只有 ～35% 结过婚，同样降幅超过～20%，而且我们只用 5 年，还是遥遥领先。</p><p data-pid=\"5VzsiDw5\">再看看美国男性：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8256304e46c66f1427f9b2555ac22afa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-bff085c36d33c54d33e8bd8b21fa0df0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-bff085c36d33c54d33e8bd8b21fa0df0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1800\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8256304e46c66f1427f9b2555ac22afa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-bff085c36d33c54d33e8bd8b21fa0df0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-bff085c36d33c54d33e8bd8b21fa0df0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1800\"/></figure><blockquote data-pid=\"Pw864NT8\">数据来源：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.allendowney.com/blog/2019/02/21/are-men-getting-married-later-or-never-both/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Are men getting married later or never?  Both.</a></blockquote><p data-pid=\"1xHR3saR\">美国 80 后男性的初婚年龄中位数是 30 岁，而 90 后是 35 岁。</p><p data-pid=\"AM9Z_740\">美国 80 后男性在 44 岁还未结婚的有 30%，而 90 后是 37%。</p><p data-pid=\"Ui-xFyb2\">注：以上数据皆根据趋势估计，注意图中的灰色线。</p><p data-pid=\"7srayWRC\">而且这个趋势线在 45 岁后就趋于平缓了，意味着终生未婚率也就是在这个数值，不会显著下降。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-1\">相关译文</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-ac9cf43234d4ca757075da06627238f9_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1906\" data-image-width=\"4058\" data-tm-id=\"5828225966\" href=\"#/post/5828225966\">叶峻峣：作为基建的双赢婴儿</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-28e307d63b5219eef733a2b0fbeaebaa_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"2373\" data-image-width=\"2811\" data-tm-id=\"5830800685\" href=\"#/post/5830800685\">叶峻峣：政府债务能否解决生育率问题？</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-8b4fc775d9c3b6df1f4bd194bb5ef654_180x120.jpg\" data-